# Vauban-specific bean discovery list. MansartDataExtension (the BCE) is NOT listed here —
# Vauban now picks it up via the standard CDI 4.1 ServiceLoader contract
# (META-INF/services/jakarta.enterprise.inject.build.compatible.spi.BuildCompatibleExtension).
#
# @Singleton + @Produces RepositoryRuntime — regular CDI bean, must be listed for Vauban
# (the application's vauban-processor APT only sees the user's own classes, not those of
# transitively-pulled libraries like mansart-data-cdi).
io.vidocq.mansart.data.cdi.MansartRuntimeProducer
